(44312, 637, 749, '<td valign="top">The blue lighting is great, but its a shame that the cds in the background aren''t angled to reflect the light into the lens as well as the front ones do.</td>', 'The blue lighting is great, but its a shame that the cds in the background aren''t angled to reflect the light into the lens as well as the front ones do.', '2002-04-08 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
