(44314, 637, 472, '<td valign="top">amazing pic. im glad i didnt decide to do cd''s as well. it wouldnt have been as good as this!  how did youget the color? blue gel? white balance shift?</td>', 'amazing pic. im glad i didnt decide to do cd''s as well. it wouldnt have been as good as this!  how did youget the color? blue gel? white balance shift?', '2002-04-08 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
