(44324, 637, 441, '<td valign="top">well hell! another shot better than mine! superb subject, composition and great lighting. damn, I love this pic.</td>', 'well hell! another shot better than mine! superb subject, composition and great lighting. damn, I love this pic.', '2002-04-10 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
