(44349, 639, 107, '<td valign="top">nice colour contrast</td>', 'nice colour contrast', '2002-04-08 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44350, 639, 656, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot.</td>', 'Great macro shot.', '2002-04-08 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44351, 639, 714, '<td valign="top">I like it.  This would make a great puzzle on Shockwave.</td>', 'I like it.  This would make a great puzzle on Shockwave.', '2002-04-08 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44352, 639, 280, '<td valign="top">Thats a lot of curves in one photo, The B&amp;W works well with the metal.</td>', 'Thats a lot of curves in one photo, The B&W works well with the metal.', '2002-04-08 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44353, 639, 279, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W!</td>', 'Good use of B&W!', '2002-04-08 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44354, 639, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has also made my top 10 favorites!  I am a macro fan and I enjoy doing them too.  I see no focus problems and the contrast is excellent.  Score: 9</td>', 'This photo has also made my top 10 favorites!  I am a macro fan and I enjoy doing them too.  I see no focus problems and the contrast is excellent.  Score: 9', '2002-04-08 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44355, 639, 387, '<td valign="top">lots of interesting angles and curves. one of the exceptions where centering works for the shot.</td>', 'lots of interesting angles and curves. one of the exceptions where centering works for the shot.', '2002-04-08 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44356, 639, 749, '<td valign="top">The monochrome makes for a good industrial effect, but the bottom part of the sprockets are very dark and a bit indistinct.</td>', 'The monochrome makes for a good industrial effect, but the bottom part of the sprockets are very dark and a bit indistinct.', '2002-04-08 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44357, 639, 312, '<td valign="top">i like this shot. the contrast is good and there are a lot of little curves to it once you really look at it. it''s very detailed and intricate. however, something is lacking in the overall composition. i think the positioning could be better (too centered) and maybe a wider angle would have allowed things to come together a little more. this might be a little too close up to capture the full effect. good shot, though.</td>', 'i like this shot. the contrast is good and there are a lot of little curves to it once you really look at it. it''s very detailed and intricate. however, something is lacking in the overall composition. i think the positioning could be better (too centered) and maybe a wider angle would have allowed things to come together a little more. this might be a little too close up to capture the full effect. good shot, though.', '2002-04-08 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44358, 639, 428, '<td valign="top">good capture of the theme</td>', 'good capture of the theme', '2002-04-08 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44359, 639, 641, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the black and white really makes it.</td>', 'Great shot, the black and white really makes it.', '2002-04-09 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44360, 639, 472, '<td valign="top">good image.  niceframing.  feels a little offcenter, tho.</td>', 'good image.  niceframing.  feels a little offcenter, tho.', '2002-04-09 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44361, 639, 352, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity, very solid shot!</td>', 'Excellent clarity, very solid shot!', '2002-04-09 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44362, 639, 441, '<td valign="top">superb detail, good exposure.</td>', 'superb detail, good exposure.', '2002-04-09 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44363, 639, 884, '<td valign="top">Interesting..</td>', 'Interesting..', '2002-04-09 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44364, 639, 244, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the composition I really wonder what it would have looked like in color could have been really cool if some of the components were really bright colors like a bright blue or red.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the composition I really wonder what it would have looked like in color could have been really cool if some of the components were really bright colors like a bright blue or red.', '2002-04-09 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44365, 639, 549, '<td valign="top">nice. Makes you look at ordinary stuff in a new light. That the way it should be.</td>', 'nice. Makes you look at ordinary stuff in a new light. That the way it should be.', '2002-04-09 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44366, 639, 797, '<td valign="top">metallic shots always seem to work. would have liked a little more glimmer on the silver.</td>', 'metallic shots always seem to work. would have liked a little more glimmer on the silver.', '2002-04-09 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44367, 639, 929, '<td valign="top">Focus is perfect!</td>', 'Focus is perfect!', '2002-04-10 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44368, 639, 543, '<td valign="top">A little straight-on, but good.</td>', 'A little straight-on, but good.', '2002-04-10 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44369, 639, 139, '<td valign="top">Nice curves, very nice execution.</td>', 'Nice curves, very nice execution.', '2002-04-11 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44370, 639, 245, '<td valign="top">I think this could benefit from a more formal, centered framing, or if you offset it even more to capture the teeth of the outer gear along the left side. Nice contrast, this works really well in black and white!</td>', 'I think this could benefit from a more formal, centered framing, or if you offset it even more to capture the teeth of the outer gear along the left side. Nice contrast, this works really well in black and white!', '2002-04-11 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44371, 639, 705, '<td valign="top">maybe in color?  for the reflections?  I dunno;  it''s a nice detail; a bit off center-I think with such a precise subject, a precise framing would be better.</td>', 'maybe in color?  for the reflections?  I dunno;  it''s a nice detail; a bit off center-I think with such a precise subject, a precise framing would be better.', '2002-04-13 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44372, 639, 113, '<td valign="top">I like the symetry, but I might have backed up a bit more.</td>', 'I like the symetry, but I might have backed up a bit more.', '2002-04-14 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44373, 639, 446, '<td valign="top">Curves, curves everywhere.  Good shot.</td>', 'Curves, curves everywhere.  Good shot.', '2002-04-14 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44374, 639, 1, '<td valign="top">it seems a little dark.  i think maybe a wider crop would''ve worked better.</td>', 'it seems a little dark.  i think maybe a wider crop would''ve worked better.', '2002-04-14 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44375, 639, 554, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-04-14 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44376, 644, 651, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF on this one..</td>', 'I really like the DOF on this one..', '2002-04-08 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44377, 644, 107, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and depth given in this picture.  the fact that its in black and white sets it off perfectly.</td>', 'I love the perspective and depth given in this picture.  the fact that its in black and white sets it off perfectly.', '2002-04-08 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44378, 644, 656, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Strong, graphic shot.  The very blurred pieces in the foreground are a distraction.  Would have been better to have a knife sharp foreground and fading/ blurring in the background.</td>', 'Ouch!  Strong, graphic shot.  The very blurred pieces in the foreground are a distraction.  Would have been better to have a knife sharp foreground and fading/ blurring in the background.', '2002-04-08 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44379, 644, 509, '<td valign="top">That looks painful!  Nicely done, but the one in front is out of focus and takes away from the impact of the "sharpness" of the razors.  It''s "dull"...ok, I''ll stop playing on the words now = )</td>', 'That looks painful!  Nicely done, but the one in front is out of focus and takes away from the impact of the "sharpness" of the razors.  It''s "dull"...ok, I''ll stop playing on the words now = )', '2002-04-08 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44380, 644, 640, '<td valign="top">I like it. Unique</td>', 'I like it. Unique', '2002-04-08 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44381, 644, 279, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I didn''t enter my barbed wire shot, yours is superior! :)</td>', 'I''m glad I didn''t enter my barbed wire shot, yours is superior! :)', '2002-04-08 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44382, 644, 280, '<td valign="top">I wish this was angled a little more to the right, I find my eye is drawn to the edge of this photo and not in to it.</td>', 'I wish this was angled a little more to the right, I find my eye is drawn to the edge of this photo and not in to it.', '2002-04-08 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44383, 644, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Don''t care for the fact that the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Don''t care for the fact that the horizon is tilted.', '2002-04-08 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44384, 644, 772, '<td valign="top">This is another nice photo.  I have trouble with photos where the closer objects are out of focus and the deeper objects are sharp.... The concept here is great and the composition is very good as well...</td>', 'This is another nice photo.  I have trouble with photos where the closer objects are out of focus and the deeper objects are sharp.... The concept here is great and the composition is very good as well...', '2002-04-08 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44385, 644, 312, '<td valign="top">i love this photo. good choice on the black and white. the repetition is great and focal point is just right. great positioning, as well. the variety of different contrasts really make this stand out. my favorite of this challenge, great job!</td>', 'i love this photo. good choice on the black and white. the repetition is great and focal point is just right. great positioning, as well. the variety of different contrasts really make this stand out. my favorite of this challenge, great job!', '2002-04-08 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44386, 644, 749, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and clear focus really pick up the barbs. Maybe if you''d taken the shot angled slightly more to the right, it would clear the foreground blur.</td>', 'Harsh lighting and clear focus really pick up the barbs. Maybe if you''d taken the shot angled slightly more to the right, it would clear the foreground blur.', '2002-04-08 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44387, 644, 387, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF, repetition and contrast.</td>', 'Good use of DOF, repetition and contrast.', '2002-04-08 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44388, 644, 714, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shoot,  the bottom left corner is a little distracting though.  great curves.</td>', 'I think this is a great shoot,  the bottom left corner is a little distracting though.  great curves.', '2002-04-08 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44389, 644, 441, '<td valign="top">Didn''t think much to this shot until I saw the full image - wow! superb detail, a bitch to compose I bet! - this is one wall I would not vault over without cast iron shorts.  great subject - Ilike.</td>', 'Didn''t think much to this shot until I saw the full image - wow! superb detail, a bitch to compose I bet! - this is one wall I would not vault over without cast iron shorts.  great subject - Ilike.', '2002-04-08 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44390, 644, 472, '<td valign="top">dangerous curves of pain!  great pic.</td>', 'dangerous curves of pain!  great pic.', '2002-04-08 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44391, 644, 57, '<td valign="top">Just looking at this is scary - the b&amp;w adds to that mood perfectly.</td>', 'Just looking at this is scary - the b&w adds to that mood perfectly.', '2002-04-08 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44392, 644, 428, '<td valign="top">good idea, but the focusing is off.</td>', 'good idea, but the focusing is off.', '2002-04-08 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44393, 644, 587, '<td valign="top">that is some mean looking metal - great shot!</td>', 'that is some mean looking metal - great shot!', '2002-04-09 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44394, 644, 641, '<td valign="top">wow.. those are sharp! I like the black and white very effective. Color would have made the background distracting.</td>', 'wow.. those are sharp! I like the black and white very effective. Color would have made the background distracting.', '2002-04-09 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44395, 644, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the angle, focus, and the b/w fits it perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the angle, focus, and the b/w fits it perfectly.', '2002-04-09 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44396, 644, 139, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a nice photo.  The bottom left corner is distracting though.</td>', 'Great idea and a nice photo.  The bottom left corner is distracting though.', '2002-04-09 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44397, 644, 884, '<td valign="top">Looks cool, but what is it?</td>', 'Looks cool, but what is it?', '2002-04-09 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44398, 644, 549, '<td valign="top">I really like this. cool idea to have some soft focus razors. Implies motion like they are turning. This gets high marks.</td>', 'I really like this. cool idea to have some soft focus razors. Implies motion like they are turning. This gets high marks.', '2002-04-09 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44399, 644, 797, '<td valign="top">ouch. this looks painful. i hope it''s not some kind of torture device. very nice find.</td>', 'ouch. this looks painful. i hope it''s not some kind of torture device. very nice find.', '2002-04-09 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44400, 644, 543, '<td valign="top">A little oversharpened, and the oof front strands detract (and make a triangle in the LLHC which draws me to the building in the bg, putting a ding in the otherwise very good angle effect).  That said, I wish I had one just like it.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A little oversharpened, and the oof front strands detract (and make a triangle in the LLHC which draws me to the building in the bg, putting a ding in the otherwise very good angle effect).  That said, I wish I had one just like it.  Nicely done.', '2002-04-10 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44401, 644, 347, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Jeremy.</td>', 'Nice shot, Jeremy.', '2002-04-10 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44402, 644, 886, '<td valign="top">Careful! How did you get inside there?</td>', 'Careful! How did you get inside there?', '2002-04-10 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44403, 644, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool image -- the range of greytones in this image is awesome.</td>', 'Very cool image -- the range of greytones in this image is awesome.', '2002-04-11 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44404, 644, 436, '<td valign="top">ouch!</td>', 'ouch!', '2002-04-11 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44405, 644, 142, '<td valign="top">Ouch, so sharp it hurts to look at it.  Good interpretation of the challenge.  I think some people may be pointing out the lack of focus on some of the wire but I think it adds a touch of interest.</td>', 'Ouch, so sharp it hurts to look at it.  Good interpretation of the challenge.  I think some people may be pointing out the lack of focus on some of the wire but I think it adds a touch of interest.', '2002-04-11 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44406, 644, 352, '<td valign="top">I like the mental contrast of the gracefulness of curves and the harshness of the razor wire.  Did you get a shot where teh depth of field put the coil in focus?  Black and white to me looks better if there aren''t such large areas of out of focus subject (I''d say about 1/3 at most here is in focus)</td>', 'I like the mental contrast of the gracefulness of curves and the harshness of the razor wire.  Did you get a shot where teh depth of field put the coil in focus?  Black and white to me looks better if there aren''t such large areas of out of focus subject (I''d say about 1/3 at most here is in focus)', '2002-04-12 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44407, 644, 811, '<td valign="top">That looks painful; hope you didn''t get hurt shooting it.  The fuzziness in front is kind of distracting.</td>', 'That looks painful; hope you didn''t get hurt shooting it.  The fuzziness in front is kind of distracting.', '2002-04-12 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44408, 644, 705, '<td valign="top">good angle; I think the focus should be on the closest bit of wire; good choice on b&amp;w;</td>', 'good angle; I think the focus should be on the closest bit of wire; good choice on b&w;', '2002-04-13 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44409, 644, 554, '<td valign="top">ouch!  good shot</td>', 'ouch!  good shot', '2002-04-14 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44410, 644, 902, '<td valign="top">very surreal</td>', 'very surreal', '2002-04-14 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44411, 645, 656, '<td valign="top">You need an ugly woman at the bottom of this glass... or two glasses with an ugly and attractive woman</td>', 'You need an ugly woman at the bottom of this glass... or two glasses with an ugly and attractive woman', '2002-04-08 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44412, 645, 472, '<td valign="top">i like this.  the circularity is compelling.</td>', 'i like this.  the circularity is compelling.', '2002-04-08 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44413, 645, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective...  I would like it better without the hand....</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective...  I would like it better without the hand....', '2002-04-08 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44414, 645, 57, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective into the glass.  Brighter lighting and a more colorful backround might add oomph to this pic.  I like how the lines of the canvas (or whatever) distort into curves.</td>', 'Nice perspective into the glass.  Brighter lighting and a more colorful backround might add oomph to this pic.  I like how the lines of the canvas (or whatever) distort into curves.', '2002-04-08 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44415, 645, 244, '<td valign="top">Where is the beer?</td>', 'Where is the beer?', '2002-04-08 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
