(44486, 648, 352, '<td valign="top">I like how the rocks cover the perpendicular slots in the middle of the track at the beginning.  Was this intentional, or did this only happen at this curve?  A deeper depth of field may have made this a bit more alluring.  I don''t see a reason to make the foreground and background out of focus.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like how the rocks cover the perpendicular slots in the middle of the track at the beginning.  Was this intentional, or did this only happen at this curve?  A deeper depth of field may have made this a bit more alluring.  I don''t see a reason to make the foreground and background out of focus.  Nice job!', '2002-04-09 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44487, 648, 883, '<td valign="top">Nice, though I imagine this isn''t a particularly short track!  I want to see more of the picture and ''texture''.</td>', 'Nice, though I imagine this isn''t a particularly short track!  I want to see more of the picture and ''texture''.', '2002-04-09 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
