(44660, 658, 244, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the use of the white background really keeps your focus on the subjects.  Would have liked it better if the image was a litter sharper though</td>', 'I like the idea and the use of the white background really keeps your focus on the subjects.  Would have liked it better if the image was a litter sharper though', '2002-04-09 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
