(44666, 658, 301, '<td valign="top">like the concept, but the blue ring around the vase''s neck is a distracting background.  May have been better pulling the roses out of their vase and positioning them lower.</td>', 'like the concept, but the blue ring around the vase''s neck is a distracting background.  May have been better pulling the roses out of their vase and positioning them lower.', '2002-04-12 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
