(44670, 658, 637, '<td valign="top">Great idea... execution isn''t quite right for me.  Maybe its the darkness of the red flowers.</td>', 'Great idea... execution isn''t quite right for me.  Maybe its the darkness of the red flowers.', '2002-04-13 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
