(44701, 662, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the curve concept... I would like to see something more dramatic.  You have done a good job with the composition on this photo :)</td>', 'I like the curve concept... I would like to see something more dramatic.  You have done a good job with the composition on this photo :)', '2002-04-08 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
