(44705, 662, 139, '<td valign="top">I like the curves you have here, but the picture seems to be of the wood behind it.  Unfortunately, I have no suggestions as to how you could emphasize the twig in the foreground, aside from maybing pulling it out away from the building a bit.</td>', 'I like the curves you have here, but the picture seems to be of the wood behind it.  Unfortunately, I have no suggestions as to how you could emphasize the twig in the foreground, aside from maybing pulling it out away from the building a bit.', '2002-04-09 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
