(44711, 662, 347, '<td valign="top">The curve is almost overwhelmed by the straight lines, but I guess that''s what you wanted. The one drawback I see is that it looks like the plant is dead -- has it been defeated by straight lines? Small leaves or evidence of life might indicate triumph of curvature over straightness, thereby giving the image more impact.</td>', 'The curve is almost overwhelmed by the straight lines, but I guess that''s what you wanted. The one drawback I see is that it looks like the plant is dead -- has it been defeated by straight lines? Small leaves or evidence of life might indicate triumph of curvature over straightness, thereby giving the image more impact.', '2002-04-10 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44712, 662, 705, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t do anything for me; good framing</td>', 'it doesn''t do anything for me; good framing', '2002-04-13 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
