(44824, 671, 280, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the halo looks strange, too much compression maybe?</td>', 'Good idea, but the halo looks strange, too much compression maybe?', '2002-04-08 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44825, 671, 142, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the goblet picture that is also the sillouette of a face.  Very interesting and well done.</td>', 'This reminds me of the goblet picture that is also the sillouette of a face.  Very interesting and well done.', '2002-04-08 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44826, 671, 772, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is nice.  I like the concept very much.  For some reason I''m seeing a ''halo'' effect on the dark side of the face and on the outer right side of the light.  This adds an interesting characteristic to this photo = You made my top 20... Score: 7</td>', 'The composition of this photo is nice.  I like the concept very much.  For some reason I''m seeing a ''halo'' effect on the dark side of the face and on the outer right side of the light.  This adds an interesting characteristic to this photo = You made my top 20... Score: 7', '2002-04-08 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44827, 671, 714, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  nice curves</td>', 'I like your idea.  nice curves', '2002-04-08 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44828, 671, 749, '<td valign="top">Superb silhouette, which would be perfect if you''d shaved off those eyebrows :o)</td>', 'Superb silhouette, which would be perfect if you''d shaved off those eyebrows :o)', '2002-04-08 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44829, 671, 92, '<td valign="top">MY FAV !!!! What a AWESOME idea and soooooo well done !!!</td>', 'MY FAV !!!! What a AWESOME idea and soooooo well done !!!', '2002-04-08 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44830, 671, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  The moon''s silhouette looks a little distressed.  Getting really picky, getting the top edge of the light above (or below) the eyebrow would make a cleaner line there.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  The moon''s silhouette looks a little distressed.  Getting really picky, getting the top edge of the light above (or below) the eyebrow would make a cleaner line there.', '2002-04-08 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44831, 671, 446, '<td valign="top">Good job.</td>', 'Good job.', '2002-04-09 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44832, 671, 641, '<td valign="top">simple yet to the point. I like it.</td>', 'simple yet to the point. I like it.', '2002-04-09 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44833, 671, 352, '<td valign="top">Intersting idea to include the backlighting as an object in and of itself in the photo.  It works well.</td>', 'Intersting idea to include the backlighting as an object in and of itself in the photo.  It works well.', '2002-04-09 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44834, 671, 472, '<td valign="top">great idea!  the abstraction element is very compelling as is the lighting. i wonder how youc ould have gotten the lighting to flare just a little less?</td>', 'great idea!  the abstraction element is very compelling as is the lighting. i wonder how youc ould have gotten the lighting to flare just a little less?', '2002-04-09 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44835, 671, 428, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the theme.</td>', 'Nice use of the theme.', '2002-04-09 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44836, 671, 884, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the discoloration, but nice idea.</td>', 'I don''t like the discoloration, but nice idea.', '2002-04-09 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44837, 671, 549, '<td valign="top">nice curvy and original. Good work.</td>', 'nice curvy and original. Good work.', '2002-04-09 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44838, 671, 929, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting<br/></td>', 'Very good use of lighting', '2002-04-10 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44839, 671, 347, '<td valign="top">Not bad</td>', 'Not bad', '2002-04-10 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44840, 671, 441, '<td valign="top">original idea</td>', 'original idea', '2002-04-10 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44841, 671, 139, '<td valign="top">Really great curves!  I wanted to do the nose and lips curves, also, but I didn''t know any good way to do it.  This was a really great idea, and well done.</td>', 'Really great curves!  I wanted to do the nose and lips curves, also, but I didn''t know any good way to do it.  This was a really great idea, and well done.', '2002-04-11 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44842, 671, 447, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I would like to see more light, like half circle of light, half face. Really nice.</td>', 'Very cool. I would like to see more light, like half circle of light, half face. Really nice.', '2002-04-12 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44843, 671, 739, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but not a strong composition because the subject has no action.  Just my two cents, but silhouettes are strongest when the subject is performing an action.</td>', 'Good shot, but not a strong composition because the subject has no action.  Just my two cents, but silhouettes are strongest when the subject is performing an action.', '2002-04-13 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44844, 671, 881, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure you could have done much about it, but the eyebrows/eyelashes detract from the curves</td>', 'I''m not sure you could have done much about it, but the eyebrows/eyelashes detract from the curves', '2002-04-13 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44845, 671, 113, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, nice curves.</td>', 'Neat idea, nice curves.', '2002-04-14 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44846, 671, 554, '<td valign="top">this on makes you think! nice silhouette</td>', 'this on makes you think! nice silhouette', '2002-04-14 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44847, 673, 270, '<td valign="top">Nice, although the left-bottom is not really in focus.</td>', 'Nice, although the left-bottom is not really in focus.', '2002-04-08 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44848, 673, 820, '<td valign="top">focus</td>', 'focus', '2002-04-08 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44849, 673, 656, '<td valign="top">good abstract.  Needs to be more in focus/  sharper to be a winner.</td>', 'good abstract.  Needs to be more in focus/  sharper to be a winner.', '2002-04-08 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44850, 673, 772, '<td valign="top">As an employee of a manufacturing facility that does a lot of machining, I like the subject of your photo.  I hope i''m not mistaken that this is a metal shaving.  I like the way this photograph is composed.  Even though the left hand side of the photo is a little out of focus, I''m scoring this photo a little higher than i normally would.  Nice work!</td>', 'As an employee of a manufacturing facility that does a lot of machining, I like the subject of your photo.  I hope i''m not mistaken that this is a metal shaving.  I like the way this photograph is composed.  Even though the left hand side of the photo is a little out of focus, I''m scoring this photo a little higher than i normally would.  Nice work!', '2002-04-08 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44851, 673, 156, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-04-08 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44852, 673, 811, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet intriguing</td>', 'Simple, yet intriguing', '2002-04-08 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44853, 673, 749, '<td valign="top">It feels like you were unsure whether to focus on the foreground shiny surfaces, or the matt background surfaces, and went with a compromise.</td>', 'It feels like you were unsure whether to focus on the foreground shiny surfaces, or the matt background surfaces, and went with a compromise.', '2002-04-08 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
