(44897, 680, 640, '<td valign="top">These flowers were carved from soap and yes, they were under glass. It took me ages to decide on the angle, focus and to try to get rid of all the reflection on the glass. Thanks for all your comments. Really helpful!</td>', 'These flowers were carved from soap and yes, they were under glass. It took me ages to decide on the angle, focus and to try to get rid of all the reflection on the glass. Thanks for all your comments. Really helpful!', '2002-04-15 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(44898, 681, 259, '<td valign="top">would have been nicer if it was all in focus</td>', 'would have been nicer if it was all in focus', '2002-04-08 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44899, 681, 536, '<td valign="top">This is freaky cool. Almost icky :) I like.</td>', 'This is freaky cool. Almost icky :) I like.', '2002-04-08 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
