(45229, 712, 955, '<td valign="top">Great impact - visually stunning</td>', 'Great impact - visually stunning', '2002-04-14 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45230, 712, 661, '<td valign="top">For those who asked, Jade is considered a succulent (doesn''t need much water) and is a common plant in California and Arizona gardens.  I don''t know whether it is eatable or not but I certainly wouldn''t eat it.  And the "misting" was natural, I took the picture early Saturday morning after it rained.   I was sorry I had to crop it like I did.  However, to achieve the 480 X 640 requirement, part of the right side had to go.  Thanks for all the great comments.  This is a marvelous website.</td>', 'For those who asked, Jade is considered a succulent (doesn''t need much water) and is a common plant in California and Arizona gardens.  I don''t know whether it is eatable or not but I certainly wouldn''t eat it.  And the "misting" was natural, I took the picture early Saturday morning after it rained.   I was sorry I had to crop it like I did.  However, to achieve the 480 X 640 requirement, part of the right side had to go.  Thanks for all the great comments.  This is a marvelous website.', '2002-04-15 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(45231, 713, 651, '<td valign="top">Great shot..</td>', 'Great shot..', '2002-04-08 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45232, 713, 531, '<td valign="top">yea, nice curve</td>', 'yea, nice curve', '2002-04-08 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45233, 713, 656, '<td valign="top">background is a bit busy - maybe a lower angle could of hidden that ?</td>', 'background is a bit busy - maybe a lower angle could of hidden that ?', '2002-04-08 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45234, 713, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture and shape of this sculpture.  I can see that you had to photograph it from a difficult angle.  As I view this photo, I ask myself what the result would have been if it had been photographed at night with some type of lighting... maybe backlit?  That would remove the background from this image and create a really neat perspective.  The blue skyline right against the top edge of the statue is a bit distracting to me.  Excellent choice of curves though :)</td>', 'I really like the texture and shape of this sculpture.  I can see that you had to photograph it from a difficult angle.  As I view this photo, I ask myself what the result would have been if it had been photographed at night with some type of lighting... maybe backlit?  That would remove the background from this image and create a really neat perspective.  The blue skyline right against the top edge of the statue is a bit distracting to me.  Excellent choice of curves though :)', '2002-04-08 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45235, 713, 749, '<td valign="top">Feels industrial, with panel-beaten curves, but it needs slightly more light.</td>', 'Feels industrial, with panel-beaten curves, but it needs slightly more light.', '2002-04-08 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
