(45646, 738, 527, '<td valign="top">Roads seamed real easy for this challenge but your photo is the exception. I really like it. I wonder what it would look like at night, wet, and with a full moon shining on it.</td>', 'Roads seamed real easy for this challenge but your photo is the exception. I really like it. I wonder what it would look like at night, wet, and with a full moon shining on it.', '2002-04-12 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
