(45655, 738, 772, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed reading all the comments on your photo.  I see that I''m not the only one that thought it was the Blue Ridge Parkway!  Lots of people think this is a road they know so it''s a great choice...  Congratulations on your win!</td>', 'I enjoyed reading all the comments on your photo.  I see that I''m not the only one that thought it was the Blue Ridge Parkway!  Lots of people think this is a road they know so it''s a great choice...  Congratulations on your win!', '2002-04-18 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(45656, 739, 270, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but would have been better if the top-left of the flower was also in focus.</td>', 'Lovely, but would have been better if the top-left of the flower was also in focus.', '2002-04-08 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45657, 739, 656, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower shot.  Bit too tight on the right side, and top petal.</td>', 'Pretty flower shot.  Bit too tight on the right side, and top petal.', '2002-04-08 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45658, 739, 772, '<td valign="top">The detail you have captured in this photo is very nice.  The background in this shot is blurred out nicely with the shallow depth of field.  You may want to try this photograph again sometime with a black piece of paper behind the flower to really bring the flower out.  Even thought the background is blurred, it is ''busy'' with activity... I think I can see an orange garden hose maybe?</td>', 'The detail you have captured in this photo is very nice.  The background in this shot is blurred out nicely with the shallow depth of field.  You may want to try this photograph again sometime with a black piece of paper behind the flower to really bring the flower out.  Even thought the background is blurred, it is ''busy'' with activity... I think I can see an orange garden hose maybe?', '2002-04-08 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45659, 739, 156, '<td valign="top">awesome closeup, great job!</td>', 'awesome closeup, great job!', '2002-04-08 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45660, 739, 749, '<td valign="top">Great detail and near perfect focus, but it feels suspended in mid-air. Maybe a curvey stalk would help?</td>', 'Great detail and near perfect focus, but it feels suspended in mid-air. Maybe a curvey stalk would help?', '2002-04-08 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45661, 739, 387, '<td valign="top">nice color and angle. good detail in the lines.</td>', 'nice color and angle. good detail in the lines.', '2002-04-08 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
