(45663, 739, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Would have liked to have seen you avoid the blown highlights and the unnatractive background.  The lower left petal is close to perfect in exposure in my opinion.  I scored it high.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Would have liked to have seen you avoid the blown highlights and the unnatractive background.  The lower left petal is close to perfect in exposure in my opinion.  I scored it high.', '2002-04-09 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45664, 739, 797, '<td valign="top">amazing clarity. so crisp you could eat it.</td>', 'amazing clarity. so crisp you could eat it.', '2002-04-09 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45665, 739, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting flower. nice shot. good focus and composition. i''m not much of a fan of generic flower shots, but this is well done.</td>', 'this is a very interesting flower. nice shot. good focus and composition. i''m not much of a fan of generic flower shots, but this is well done.', '2002-04-09 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45666, 739, 720, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, looks almost surreal. Good job.</td>', 'Very pretty, looks almost surreal. Good job.', '2002-04-09 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45667, 739, 472, '<td valign="top">a lovely flower</td>', 'a lovely flower', '2002-04-09 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45668, 739, 352, '<td valign="top">A shallower depth of field would improve this image to me.  That would put the background out of focus a bit and could be accomplished with a lower fStop (aperature.)</td>', 'A shallower depth of field would improve this image to me.  That would put the background out of focus a bit and could be accomplished with a lower fStop (aperature.)', '2002-04-09 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45669, 739, 428, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I know there are a few who will say they don''t like the flower shots, but I love flower shots!  Nice color and texture, I feel you captured the theme well.  The only flaws are a little out of focus at the top and the framing is a little off. I would have had more of the flower showing on the top and right side. Plus maybe a little more blur to the background.</td>', 'nice shot, I know there are a few who will say they don''t like the flower shots, but I love flower shots!  Nice color and texture, I feel you captured the theme well.  The only flaws are a little out of focus at the top and the framing is a little off. I would have had more of the flower showing on the top and right side. Plus maybe a little more blur to the background.', '2002-04-09 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45670, 739, 441, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful with curves!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful with curves!', '2002-04-09 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
