(45682, 739, 587, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of the nice compliments and constructive remarks.  This plant has a very long curving stem and so I tucked the flower up into this ivy to hold it still so I could take its picture - wasn''t comfortable blurring the background, didn''t want to get disqualified. Thanks again for the comments. Since this was my first entry, I have a little more idea of what to look for next time.</td>', 'Thank you for all of the nice compliments and constructive remarks.  This plant has a very long curving stem and so I tucked the flower up into this ivy to hold it still so I could take its picture - wasn''t comfortable blurring the background, didn''t want to get disqualified. Thanks again for the comments. Since this was my first entry, I have a little more idea of what to look for next time.', '2002-04-15 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(45683, 743, 270, '<td valign="top">Needs a lot of cropping to get rid of all the unused space in the sky.</td>', 'Needs a lot of cropping to get rid of all the unused space in the sky.', '2002-04-08 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
