(45699, 743, 113, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle, like from a lower height, showing more of the ground and fence, rather than have so much sky.</td>', 'I think a different angle, like from a lower height, showing more of the ground and fence, rather than have so much sky.', '2002-04-10 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
