(45712, 746, 772, '<td valign="top">I played around with this idea myself.. I turned the lights off in the kitchen and got the burner red hot and photographed it with a longer exposure....  My drip pan was clean and it was reflecting the red hot burner ;)</td>', 'I played around with this idea myself.. I turned the lights off in the kitchen and got the burner red hot and photographed it with a longer exposure....  My drip pan was clean and it was reflecting the red hot burner ;)', '2002-04-08 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
