(45715, 746, 312, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo, and the subject is great. however, i think you could have done more with this subject. the detail that his provides is nice, but i think a wider angle would have shown more of the coils and produced a better effect. the center piece of the coils has some interesting flavor to it, and i''m sorry to see it cropped out at the edge like that. overall, though, this is very nice. good job.</td>', 'i really like this photo, and the subject is great. however, i think you could have done more with this subject. the detail that his provides is nice, but i think a wider angle would have shown more of the coils and produced a better effect. the center piece of the coils has some interesting flavor to it, and i''m sorry to see it cropped out at the edge like that. overall, though, this is very nice. good job.', '2002-04-08 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45716, 746, 57, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping and detail, the yellowish lighting bothers me for some reason.</td>', 'Nice cropping and detail, the yellowish lighting bothers me for some reason.', '2002-04-08 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(45717, 746, 244, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, wonderful concept, great detail, and the little bit of a yellow overcast seems to add age.  The only thing that I think could have improved it would be if the coils were red hot, but that wouldn''t have been good for your camera though.  I love this shot.</td>', 'I love this shot, wonderful concept, great detail, and the little bit of a yellow overcast seems to add age.  The only thing that I think could have improved it would be if the coils were red hot, but that wouldn''t have been good for your camera though.  I love this shot.', '2002-04-08 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
