(45733, 746, 1034, '<td valign="top">I love it!  I think it''s a great piece.  The dirty imperfections give it it''s whole personality.  Great work!</td>', 'I love it!  I think it''s a great piece.  The dirty imperfections give it it''s whole personality.  Great work!', '2002-04-14 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
