(45750, 747, 543, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the fg chrome, and great high contrast tone.  Even better with less depth of field to get a creamier bg, but that can be tough to do with a digital.  Bravo.</td>', 'Great texture on the fg chrome, and great high contrast tone.  Even better with less depth of field to get a creamier bg, but that can be tough to do with a digital.  Bravo.', '2002-04-10 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
