(45796, 749, 509, '<td valign="top">More detail in the shadows would have been nice.  The steel bars don''t appear symmetrical here, but you centerred them.  I think the picture would have been better taken at a different angle or view.  Also, accentuating the lack of symmetry would have had a greater effect, rather than trying to hide it.</td>', 'More detail in the shadows would have been nice.  The steel bars don''t appear symmetrical here, but you centerred them.  I think the picture would have been better taken at a different angle or view.  Also, accentuating the lack of symmetry would have had a greater effect, rather than trying to hide it.', '2002-04-10 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
