(45845, 755, 656, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments - they are much appreciated.  This was a shot of two glasses, straight down, on white card with 4 spot lights.  It was actually the first out of several shots - I should have gone back and reshot it with better focus.  I''ll know not to be so lazy next time!  <br/><br/>It was intentionally high-key with a +2 exposure dialed in to get it really white and highlight the curve.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments - they are much appreciated.  This was a shot of two glasses, straight down, on white card with 4 spot lights.  It was actually the first out of several shots - I should have gone back and reshot it with better focus.  I''ll know not to be so lazy next time!  It was intentionally high-key with a +2 exposure dialed in to get it really white and highlight the curve.', '2002-04-15 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
