(45917, 759, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you haven''t heard this already but this is an EGGcellent photograph.  It is my runner up for the win in this challenge.  I can see the fine detail in the surface of this front egg.  At first, I thought there was a dirty spec on the upper left of this front egg, but it was a dirty spot on my monitor.  I fixed that and I''m scoring you a 9.  The only reason this doesn''t get a 10 is because I''m only giving one 10 and I have another favorite.... Well, I think I will give two 10''s this time because you have done a great job with this photo.... It''s EGGciting and maybe a bit EGGcentric but it''s still one of the best.  Score: 10  -- Good luck!</td>', 'I''m sure you haven''t heard this already but this is an EGGcellent photograph.  It is my runner up for the win in this challenge.  I can see the fine detail in the surface of this front egg.  At first, I thought there was a dirty spec on the upper left of this front egg, but it was a dirty spot on my monitor.  I fixed that and I''m scoring you a 9.  The only reason this doesn''t get a 10 is because I''m only giving one 10 and I have another favorite.... Well, I think I will give two 10''s this time because you have done a great job with this photo.... It''s EGGciting and maybe a bit EGGcentric but it''s still one of the best.  Score: 10  -- Good luck!', '2002-04-08 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
