(46051, 765, 428, '<td valign="top">Focus is off, tilted slightly, Each of these vases shows a nice curve. I think the shot would have been more effective if you would have chosen just one or two.  It appears that green one is reflected in a mirror?  Maybe try a shot of just that one with a reflection.  The lighting is nice</td>', 'Focus is off, tilted slightly, Each of these vases shows a nice curve. I think the shot would have been more effective if you would have chosen just one or two.  It appears that green one is reflected in a mirror?  Maybe try a shot of just that one with a reflection.  The lighting is nice', '2002-04-12 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
