(46085, 767, 543, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Maybe good to see a little more room on top, and not quite so much space to the right.  I''d have turned the bottle to avoid the code at L.  Very nice clarity and color.</td>', 'Cool.  Maybe good to see a little more room on top, and not quite so much space to the right.  I''d have turned the bottle to avoid the code at L.  Very nice clarity and color.', '2002-04-10 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
