(46100, 771, 312, '<td valign="top">this shot has some obviously great qualities. the colors! wow. i''m not sure what the subject is, but i do really like the curves on it. was this shot on a mirror? the reflection is very cool. i tend to like more "organic" shots rather than these sort of set-up shots, but this has great appeal. nice job.</td>', 'this shot has some obviously great qualities. the colors! wow. i''m not sure what the subject is, but i do really like the curves on it. was this shot on a mirror? the reflection is very cool. i tend to like more "organic" shots rather than these sort of set-up shots, but this has great appeal. nice job.', '2002-04-08 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46101, 771, 772, '<td valign="top">Let me start this comment by saying WOW!  The composition and lighting of this photo are fantastic.  I spent about 10 minutes looking at this photo.  I''m not going to make any negative comments here because I can''t think of any.  Score: 9</td>', 'Let me start this comment by saying WOW!  The composition and lighting of this photo are fantastic.  I spent about 10 minutes looking at this photo.  I''m not going to make any negative comments here because I can''t think of any.  Score: 9', '2002-04-08 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
