(46104, 771, 811, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and contrast of textures</td>', 'i like the lighting and contrast of textures', '2002-04-08 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46105, 771, 509, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this picture.  The colors are good, and the transparency of drawing tools gives the picture another dimension.  It would have been more artistic if not for the brand label on the one tool, but not much you can do about that.</td>', 'There''s just something about this picture.  The colors are good, and the transparency of drawing tools gives the picture another dimension.  It would have been more artistic if not for the brand label on the one tool, but not much you can do about that.', '2002-04-08 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46106, 771, 244, '<td valign="top">Great concept, might have helped a little if the light was not as harsh and if the lables could be removed not sure if that would be possible though</td>', 'Great concept, might have helped a little if the light was not as harsh and if the lables could be removed not sure if that would be possible though', '2002-04-08 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46107, 771, 446, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  It looks like a difficult shot to get perfect.  How did you light it?   Was there any way to avoid the strong reflections on the lower curve?  Did you try playing around with the plan view angle of the lower curve so that it was not reflecing almost directly at the lens?  I would have rated it even higher than I did if not for this small detail of the reflection.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I like the concept.  It looks like a difficult shot to get perfect.  How did you light it?   Was there any way to avoid the strong reflections on the lower curve?  Did you try playing around with the plan view angle of the lower curve so that it was not reflecing almost directly at the lens?  I would have rated it even higher than I did if not for this small detail of the reflection.  Keep up the good work!', '2002-04-09 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46108, 771, 587, '<td valign="top">Nifty!</td>', 'Nifty!', '2002-04-09 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
