(46176, 772, 935, '<td valign="top">Georgeous photo with great light. Looks like an old painting. However, I don''t think it really addresses the challenge topic. I''d give it an 8 as a photograph -- some judicious cropping of the bottom of the frame would help it, I think -- but I''d give it a 2 as far as the challenge goes. I''m pretty sure this is Yosemite (never been there, but that looks like Half Dome in the distance), which is a glacial valley and therefore very rounded, but this picture barely whispers "curves".</td>', 'Georgeous photo with great light. Looks like an old painting. However, I don''t think it really addresses the challenge topic. I''d give it an 8 as a photograph -- some judicious cropping of the bottom of the frame would help it, I think -- but I''d give it a 2 as far as the challenge goes. I''m pretty sure this is Yosemite (never been there, but that looks like Half Dome in the distance), which is a glacial valley and therefore very rounded, but this picture barely whispers "curves".', '2002-04-10 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
