(46314, 776, 554, '<td valign="top">can''t wait to find out where this is.    nice framing</td>', 'can''t wait to find out where this is.    nice framing', '2002-04-14 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46315, 780, 772, '<td valign="top">"Point Reyes" must be a very popular place.  It is indeed beautiful.  I think there are three photos in this challenge from this location.  I have also seen several landscapes in this challenge, each containing curves, but I would like to have seen more creative interpretations of ''curve''.. Keep up the good work :)</td>', '"Point Reyes" must be a very popular place.  It is indeed beautiful.  I think there are three photos in this challenge from this location.  I have also seen several landscapes in this challenge, each containing curves, but I would like to have seen more creative interpretations of ''curve''.. Keep up the good work :)', '2002-04-08 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46316, 780, 472, '<td valign="top">i like point reyes, alot!  this pic though, doesnt have a really clear subject.  it might have been better if you had gotten really close to the ground and framed part of one of those pools.</td>', 'i like point reyes, alot!  this pic though, doesnt have a really clear subject.  it might have been better if you had gotten really close to the ground and framed part of one of those pools.', '2002-04-08 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46317, 780, 57, '<td valign="top">The shapes are a little to random for me to really say "CURVES" - perhaps focusing in closer would help?  Neat pic tho.</td>', 'The shapes are a little to random for me to really say "CURVES" - perhaps focusing in closer would help?  Neat pic tho.', '2002-04-08 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46318, 780, 139, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture.  I would have liked more close up, the top part is sort of distracting and the curves are not as noticeable there.</td>', 'I really like the picture.  I would have liked more close up, the top part is sort of distracting and the curves are not as noticeable there.', '2002-04-09 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46319, 780, 117, '<td valign="top">pt. reyes one of my favorite places those tide pools are slick to walk on</td>', 'pt. reyes one of my favorite places those tide pools are slick to walk on', '2002-04-09 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46320, 780, 884, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene</td>', 'Pretty scene', '2002-04-09 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46321, 780, 244, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Can''t make my mind up if it would have been better with more sky in it or no sky at all, what is there kinda pulles your eye off the rest of the picutre.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Can''t make my mind up if it would have been better with more sky in it or no sky at all, what is there kinda pulles your eye off the rest of the picutre.', '2002-04-09 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46322, 780, 928, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2002-04-10 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46323, 780, 714, '<td valign="top">very crisp,  nice :)</td>', 'very crisp,  nice :)', '2002-04-10 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46324, 780, 245, '<td valign="top">Watch your step!</td>', 'Watch your step!', '2002-04-10 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46325, 780, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot of curves in nature</td>', 'Interesting shot of curves in nature', '2002-04-11 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46326, 780, 189, '<td valign="top">Where are the curves?</td>', 'Where are the curves?', '2002-04-11 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46327, 780, 352, '<td valign="top">The reflections off the water are a bit too bright compared to the deep green for my taste.  Maybe a polarizer would help out here.</td>', 'The reflections off the water are a bit too bright compared to the deep green for my taste.  Maybe a polarizer would help out here.', '2002-04-12 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46328, 780, 656, '<td valign="top">good compositional choice, filling the frame well. <br/><br/>Light is rather uninspired, making the shot a bit dull/ uninteresting.</td>', 'good compositional choice, filling the frame well. Light is rather uninspired, making the shot a bit dull/ uninteresting.', '2002-04-13 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46329, 780, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though the colors are a bit dull.  As for curves, you might be reaching here.</td>', 'Interesting, though the colors are a bit dull.  As for curves, you might be reaching here.', '2002-04-13 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46330, 780, 441, '<td valign="top">Sorry, no real curves here</td>', 'Sorry, no real curves here', '2002-04-13 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46331, 780, 2, '<td valign="top">Photo seems just slightly out of focus.  A little more balance at the top of this image might have helped the composition, too.</td>', 'Photo seems just slightly out of focus.  A little more balance at the top of this image might have helped the composition, too.', '2002-04-13 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46332, 780, 739, '<td valign="top">Looks messy to be walking around in this area.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'Looks messy to be walking around in this area.  Interesting shot.', '2002-04-13 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46333, 780, 637, '<td valign="top">Not curvy enough for us.</td>', 'Not curvy enough for us.', '2002-04-13 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46334, 781, 820, '<td valign="top">Cropped down so the horizon was out of view and this would have been a really good composition and taken it a step beyond a semi-overcast looking beach shot.</td>', 'Cropped down so the horizon was out of view and this would have been a really good composition and taken it a step beyond a semi-overcast looking beach shot.', '2002-04-08 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46335, 781, 656, '<td valign="top">Needed better light to make this really work.</td>', 'Needed better light to make this really work.', '2002-04-08 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46336, 781, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, although more focus on the actual curves, instead of the ocean skyline would''ve fit the challenge idea better.</td>', 'Interesting shot, although more focus on the actual curves, instead of the ocean skyline would''ve fit the challenge idea better.', '2002-04-08 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46337, 781, 734, '<td valign="top">Nice image, mabe to much sky</td>', 'Nice image, mabe to much sky', '2002-04-08 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46338, 781, 279, '<td valign="top">If only the sky was blue... :)</td>', 'If only the sky was blue... :)', '2002-04-08 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46339, 781, 772, '<td valign="top">This, once again, must be a popular place.. I think there are three entrys from "point reyes" in this challenge.  I particularly like the footprints in the sand...</td>', 'This, once again, must be a popular place.. I think there are three entrys from "point reyes" in this challenge.  I particularly like the footprints in the sand...', '2002-04-08 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46340, 781, 92, '<td valign="top">I like how the curves stand out against the straight line of birds and straight line of the waters edge. Nice picture !</td>', 'I like how the curves stand out against the straight line of birds and straight line of the waters edge. Nice picture !', '2002-04-08 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46341, 781, 749, '<td valign="top">A multitude of curves lead the eye out, but to a flat horizon. I would personally cut the image in half, and use solely the bottom half, which would emphasise more the shapes within the different flows of water.</td>', 'A multitude of curves lead the eye out, but to a flat horizon. I would personally cut the image in half, and use solely the bottom half, which would emphasise more the shapes within the different flows of water.', '2002-04-08 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46342, 781, 472, '<td valign="top">i would have cropped this off just above the water.</td>', 'i would have cropped this off just above the water.', '2002-04-08 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46343, 781, 57, '<td valign="top">Nature''s curves - nice!  Too bad the weather wasn''t nicer....</td>', 'Nature''s curves - nice!  Too bad the weather wasn''t nicer....', '2002-04-08 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46344, 781, 641, '<td valign="top">Natures curves...very nice</td>', 'Natures curves...very nice', '2002-04-09 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46345, 781, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo..wish I was there</td>', 'Beautiful photo..wish I was there', '2002-04-09 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46346, 781, 352, '<td valign="top">Incredible range of contrast.  Good job!  I like the placement of the horizone line, and the addition of the birds make this feel better somehow.  Like this one!!</td>', 'Incredible range of contrast.  Good job!  I like the placement of the horizone line, and the addition of the birds make this feel better somehow.  Like this one!!', '2002-04-09 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46347, 781, 280, '<td valign="top">A shame it wasn''t a brighter day.</td>', 'A shame it wasn''t a brighter day.', '2002-04-09 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46348, 781, 139, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I''d like it better if you took it standing in the water so the water is more centered, but I can completely understand a hesitancy to stand in water with your camera :)</td>', 'I like it.  I''d like it better if you took it standing in the water so the water is more centered, but I can completely understand a hesitancy to stand in water with your camera :)', '2002-04-09 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46349, 781, 718, '<td valign="top">Maybe you shoul have panned down a touch.</td>', 'Maybe you shoul have panned down a touch.', '2002-04-09 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(46350, 781, 549, '<td valign="top">a few curves but otherwise seems to be just a nice shot of the ocean.</td>', 'a few curves but otherwise seems to be just a nice shot of the ocean.', '2002-04-09 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46351, 781, 441, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pic.</td>', 'Wonderful pic.', '2002-04-10 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46352, 781, 428, '<td valign="top">The colors of this are very blah. Try taking it on a day when it is not so cloudy</td>', 'The colors of this are very blah. Try taking it on a day when it is not so cloudy', '2002-04-10 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46353, 781, 811, '<td valign="top">Maybe if it was shifted a bit more to the right.</td>', 'Maybe if it was shifted a bit more to the right.', '2002-04-12 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46354, 781, 637, '<td valign="top">Curves are too "incidental" for me in this shot... sjg</td>', 'Curves are too "incidental" for me in this shot... sjg', '2002-04-13 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46355, 781, 955, '<td valign="top">Crop out distractions - birds, sea and sky and I would give it higher marks. Great foreground</td>', 'Crop out distractions - birds, sea and sky and I would give it higher marks. Great foreground', '2002-04-14 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46356, 782, 820, '<td valign="top">Well, nice shot, but bad cropping on the bottom. Kind of uninteresting composition.. no focus on a subject.</td>', 'Well, nice shot, but bad cropping on the bottom. Kind of uninteresting composition.. no focus on a subject.', '2002-04-08 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46357, 782, 656, '<td valign="top">hard to get the exposure correct.</td>', 'hard to get the exposure correct.', '2002-04-08 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46358, 782, 279, '<td valign="top">Love that color!</td>', 'Love that color!', '2002-04-08 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46359, 782, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the gold tone of this photogrpah.  I think I am seeing a lot of leftover architecture photos today....</td>', 'I really like the gold tone of this photogrpah.  I think I am seeing a lot of leftover architecture photos today....', '2002-04-08 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46360, 782, 387, '<td valign="top">nice coloring, very warm.</td>', 'nice coloring, very warm.', '2002-04-08 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46361, 782, 92, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this shot. Just beautiful. I wish the light wasn''t cut off at the bottom:( Nice piece !</td>', 'I REALLY like this shot. Just beautiful. I wish the light wasn''t cut off at the bottom:( Nice piece !', '2002-04-08 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46362, 782, 749, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of red, which make it feels too saturated, but the detail is superb.</td>', 'There''s a lot of red, which make it feels too saturated, but the detail is superb.', '2002-04-08 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46363, 782, 441, '<td valign="top">Rich shot</td>', 'Rich shot', '2002-04-08 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46364, 782, 244, '<td valign="top">I like the color, helps add mood.  I would like it alot better if it was either croped differently or taken from another angle.  Also a litte distracting cutting off the light fixtrue .</td>', 'I like the color, helps add mood.  I would like it alot better if it was either croped differently or taken from another angle.  Also a litte distracting cutting off the light fixtrue .', '2002-04-08 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46365, 782, 57, '<td valign="top">Might have been more interesting if you''d zoomed in on just part of the curve, with more emphasis on the details.  Nice glowing, warm colors.</td>', 'Might have been more interesting if you''d zoomed in on just part of the curve, with more emphasis on the details.  Nice glowing, warm colors.', '2002-04-08 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46366, 782, 587, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2002-04-09 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46367, 782, 797, '<td valign="top">Is that bright light your flash or from the chandelier?  Why decadence? I like the warm feel of the shot.</td>', 'Is that bright light your flash or from the chandelier?  Why decadence? I like the warm feel of the shot.', '2002-04-09 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46368, 782, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful place.  too bad about the hot spot.  i think you should either be pulled farther back or be closer in.</td>', 'beautiful place.  too bad about the hot spot.  i think you should either be pulled farther back or be closer in.', '2002-04-09 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46369, 782, 917, '<td valign="top">Chopped the chandelier. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Chopped the chandelier. Nice lighting.', '2002-04-10 05:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46370, 782, 245, '<td valign="top">the chandelier is awkwardly resting on the edge of the photo, and is not hanging vertically, making this feel out of balance.</td>', 'the chandelier is awkwardly resting on the edge of the photo, and is not hanging vertically, making this feel out of balance.', '2002-04-10 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46371, 782, 139, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Great color, if not just a tad too bright white in the center.</td>', 'I love it.  Great color, if not just a tad too bright white in the center.', '2002-04-11 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46372, 782, 970, '<td valign="top">good lighting</td>', 'good lighting', '2002-04-11 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46373, 782, 142, '<td valign="top">Attractive photo.  The title makes me wonder where this was taken.</td>', 'Attractive photo.  The title makes me wonder where this was taken.', '2002-04-11 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46374, 782, 352, '<td valign="top">Very Renaissanceish lighting/color.  I like how this is not centered.  A tripod and longer shutter speed might have helped here, as the flash seems to have made a bit of a hot spot on th eroof.</td>', 'Very Renaissanceish lighting/color.  I like how this is not centered.  A tripod and longer shutter speed might have helped here, as the flash seems to have made a bit of a hot spot on th eroof.', '2002-04-12 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46375, 782, 734, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, I personally would have liked to seen the frame adjusted just a little to the left,</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, I personally would have liked to seen the frame adjusted just a little to the left,', '2002-04-13 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46376, 782, 1043, '<td valign="top">love the lighting</td>', 'love the lighting', '2002-04-14 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46377, 783, 820, '<td valign="top">Ok. First, clean it off next time.<br/><br/>Next, this image is calling out for black and white. Good composition.</td>', 'Ok. First, clean it off next time.Next, this image is calling out for black and white. Good composition.', '2002-04-08 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46378, 783, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the glass but what is on the right side?</td>', 'Nice clarity on the glass but what is on the right side?', '2002-04-08 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46379, 783, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I would like it even better if it were mirrored horizontally...</td>', 'I like this photo.  I would like it even better if it were mirrored horizontally...', '2002-04-08 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46380, 783, 57, '<td valign="top">Nice - could perhaps use some more color?  Brighter lighting?  Nice sharp focus on the mid-vase.</td>', 'Nice - could perhaps use some more color?  Brighter lighting?  Nice sharp focus on the mid-vase.', '2002-04-08 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46381, 783, 139, '<td valign="top">I think less focus on the middle vase would have made this a nice abstract shot, or otherwise more focus on the outside vases (bring them in closer?).</td>', 'I think less focus on the middle vase would have made this a nice abstract shot, or otherwise more focus on the outside vases (bring them in closer?).', '2002-04-09 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46382, 783, 640, '<td valign="top">I like this! It really talks curves!</td>', 'I like this! It really talks curves!', '2002-04-09 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46383, 783, 352, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field!</td>', 'Great depth of field!', '2002-04-09 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46384, 783, 472, '<td valign="top">i like the blurry front vase.  there''s a hair or something hanging off your focussed vase, tho ; 0</td>', 'i like the blurry front vase.  there''s a hair or something hanging off your focussed vase, tho ; 0', '2002-04-09 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46385, 783, 441, '<td valign="top">nice detail and exposure.</td>', 'nice detail and exposure.', '2002-04-09 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46386, 783, 280, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo. My only complaint is the bright white reflection on the neck of the vase.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo. My only complaint is the bright white reflection on the neck of the vase.', '2002-04-09 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46387, 783, 549, '<td valign="top">just not enough going on here but I see you were on to something.</td>', 'just not enough going on here but I see you were on to something.', '2002-04-09 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46388, 783, 714, '<td valign="top">nicely done   :)</td>', 'nicely done   :)', '2002-04-10 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46389, 783, 935, '<td valign="top">Looks like a hair coming off the right side of the lip -- really distracting. Okay shot otherwise.</td>', 'Looks like a hair coming off the right side of the lip -- really distracting. Okay shot otherwise.', '2002-04-10 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46390, 783, 245, '<td valign="top">there appears to be a hair or something on the middle vase, get rid of that thing! :) Nice composition.</td>', 'there appears to be a hair or something on the middle vase, get rid of that thing! :) Nice composition.', '2002-04-10 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46391, 783, 527, '<td valign="top">I love it when someones takes something ordinary and makes something nice from it. Good job. The theme is very evident. That piece of hair is distracting, though.</td>', 'I love it when someones takes something ordinary and makes something nice from it. Good job. The theme is very evident. That piece of hair is distracting, though.', '2002-04-11 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46392, 783, 656, '<td valign="top">good concept.  Is that a hair on the glass, or on the lens ?  It distracts from the end result.</td>', 'good concept.  Is that a hair on the glass, or on the lens ?  It distracts from the end result.', '2002-04-13 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46393, 783, 739, '<td valign="top">Have you tried putting something bright and colorful behind the vase and seeing the distortion created by the vase? I like the overall composition.  The bright background really brings out the curves.</td>', 'Have you tried putting something bright and colorful behind the vase and seeing the distortion created by the vase? I like the overall composition.  The bright background really brings out the curves.', '2002-04-13 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46394, 783, 2, '<td valign="top">Though it may be part of the effect you were going for, I think I''d have liked this image better without the cast shadow.</td>', 'Though it may be part of the effect you were going for, I think I''d have liked this image better without the cast shadow.', '2002-04-13 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46395, 785, 270, '<td valign="top">The half of the photo under the fork could be easily removed, I think.</td>', 'The half of the photo under the fork could be easily removed, I think.', '2002-04-08 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46396, 785, 820, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to see a fork in the same shot as uncooked pasta. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t want to see a fork in the same shot as uncooked pasta. Sorry.', '2002-04-08 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46397, 785, 656, '<td valign="top">bit too confused.  Good concept</td>', 'bit too confused.  Good concept', '2002-04-08 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46398, 785, 509, '<td valign="top">The noodles for the most part are straight, perhaps you could have curled them more?</td>', 'The noodles for the most part are straight, perhaps you could have curled them more?', '2002-04-08 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46399, 785, 772, '<td valign="top">Since i like black and whites, I really like this photo.  I wish there was just a bit more light in the foreground...</td>', 'Since i like black and whites, I really like this photo.  I wish there was just a bit more light in the foreground...', '2002-04-08 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46400, 785, 749, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the foreground and the bleached-out look of the background give this a back-to-front feel, which isn''t always a bad thing...</td>', 'The shadow in the foreground and the bleached-out look of the background give this a back-to-front feel, which isn''t always a bad thing...', '2002-04-08 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46401, 785, 57, '<td valign="top">The fork looks cool, might have been even better without the pasta, or if the pasta was more curled.</td>', 'The fork looks cool, might have been even better without the pasta, or if the pasta was more curled.', '2002-04-08 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46402, 785, 472, '<td valign="top">this was a tough image to shoot. the fork is dark but the pasta is light. maybe more lighton the foreground would have helped.</td>', 'this was a tough image to shoot. the fork is dark but the pasta is light. maybe more lighton the foreground would have helped.', '2002-04-09 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46403, 785, 139, '<td valign="top">I like it quite a bit, but the dark area in the front is distracting.</td>', 'I like it quite a bit, but the dark area in the front is distracting.', '2002-04-09 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46404, 785, 280, '<td valign="top">The bottom right hand corner seems a little dark.</td>', 'The bottom right hand corner seems a little dark.', '2002-04-09 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46405, 785, 884, '<td valign="top">You should have used a more curvy food :)</td>', 'You should have used a more curvy food :)', '2002-04-09 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46406, 785, 714, '<td valign="top">I like it.  :)</td>', 'I like it.  :)', '2002-04-11 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46407, 785, 54, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see a color version of this.</td>', 'I''d love to see a color version of this.', '2002-04-11 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46408, 785, 352, '<td valign="top">I think this may have looked a bit better as a color shot</td>', 'I think this may have looked a bit better as a color shot', '2002-04-12 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46409, 785, 1, '<td valign="top">The image is too dark.  I don''t see a need for black and white.</td>', 'The image is too dark.  I don''t see a need for black and white.', '2002-04-13 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
