(46517, 789, 2, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph and nice effect -- though you''re slightly tilted to the left.</td>', 'Very good photograph and nice effect -- though you''re slightly tilted to the left.', '2002-04-13 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46518, 789, 739, '<td valign="top">The ghostly horses in this merry-go-around gives a huge visual clue that this is a moving object.  Good job.</td>', 'The ghostly horses in this merry-go-around gives a huge visual clue that this is a moving object.  Good job.', '2002-04-13 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46519, 789, 888, '<td valign="top">I LOVE long exposure pics like this, its just a shame my little Canon ixus can''t do them.</td>', 'I LOVE long exposure pics like this, its just a shame my little Canon ixus can''t do them.', '2002-04-13 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46520, 789, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love the way the lights curve around...not something they would normally do unless taken in motion. Just as there is motion in curves.</td>', 'I love the way the lights curve around...not something they would normally do unless taken in motion. Just as there is motion in curves.', '2002-04-14 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46521, 789, 772, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank everyone who took the opportunity to give me feedback on this photograph.  Even though I had a "stupid title", I had a great time participating in my first challenge and I''m pleased with the results.  This forum is blessed with some very talented photographers.  I hope to improve my skills through these challenges.  Cheers!</td>', 'I would like to thank everyone who took the opportunity to give me feedback on this photograph.  Even though I had a "stupid title", I had a great time participating in my first challenge and I''m pleased with the results.  This forum is blessed with some very talented photographers.  I hope to improve my skills through these challenges.  Cheers!', '2002-04-15 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(46522, 789, 772, '<td valign="top">How it was done:<br/><br/>I bought a little tabletop tripod just for this shot.  I set the camera up on the tripod and then framed my image.  I made about 30 shots at various exposure lengths between 1/60" and 2" at F8.  I used the shutter priority mode for this shot and didn''t play with manual aperture at all.  I also played with different white balance settings.  This is not a complicated shot.  It just requires a still camera and keeping people from walking in and out of the image.</td>', 'How it was done:I bought a little tabletop tripod just for this shot.  I set the camera up on the tripod and then framed my image.  I made about 30 shots at various exposure lengths between 1/60" and 2" at F8.  I used the shutter priority mode for this shot and didn''t play with manual aperture at all.  I also played with different white balance settings.  This is not a complicated shot.  It just requires a still camera and keeping people from walking in and out of the image.', '2002-04-15 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(46523, 789, 47, '<td valign="top">could have solved both problems (plant, title) by making the title something reguarding the plant. like "shunned greeneries", to imply that the poor little chloroplast motherfucker was all alone and not doing the funky curvy dance that everything else was. BUT NO. YOU HAD TO BE COOL. oh well. still a great shot, dont know why it didnt get a better rating compared to the rest of what i saw. i rated this pic above everyone else, at a 9.</td>', 'could have solved both problems (plant, title) by making the title something reguarding the plant. like "shunned greeneries", to imply that the poor little chloroplast motherfucker was all alone and not doing the funky curvy dance that everything else was. BUT NO. YOU HAD TO BE COOL. oh well. still a great shot, dont know why it didnt get a better rating compared to the rest of what i saw. i rated this pic above everyone else, at a 9.', '2002-04-17 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(46524, 789, 772, '<td valign="top">Well, I do strive to be cool... maybe one day I will reach the levels of ''coolness'' that others so eloquently display here sometimes :(</td>', 'Well, I do strive to be cool... maybe one day I will reach the levels of ''coolness'' that others so eloquently display here sometimes :(', '2002-04-18 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(46525, 789, 2427, '<td valign="top">I like this one, for lack of a better word, it''s electric, vibrant.<br/>Reminds me too of "strangers on a train" - perhaps a stretch or perhaps a bit clichéd, but alas...</td>', 'I like this one, for lack of a better word, it''s electric, vibrant.Reminds me too of "strangers on a train" - perhaps a stretch or perhaps a bit clichéd, but alas...', '2002-06-26 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
