(46544, 790, 245, '<td valign="top">That is one curvy baby! The background is a little blown out, a different angle might be called for to help reduce this, since the baby''s face could use an even lighter exposure.</td>', 'That is one curvy baby! The background is a little blown out, a different angle might be called for to help reduce this, since the baby''s face could use an even lighter exposure.', '2002-04-10 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46545, 790, 347, '<td valign="top">Ah, playing the "cute baby" card. It''s a nice portrait, but "curves" is a pretty abstract concept, I think, and bringing something as concrete as a baby into it distracts the viewers'' attention.</td>', 'Ah, playing the "cute baby" card. It''s a nice portrait, but "curves" is a pretty abstract concept, I think, and bringing something as concrete as a baby into it distracts the viewers'' attention.', '2002-04-10 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
